================================================================================
INTENT
================================================================================

Applied AI Society is, and always has been, an open-source knowledge base. The
README at the root of this repository has stated that intent since the
repository's inception. This LICENSE file is the formal expression of that
long-stated intent.

The combined effect of these licenses is simple: anyone may freely use, share,
adapt, build on, fork, or commercialize the work in this repository, with
attribution for the prose content. We want this work used. We want it forked.
We want it built on. The mission is universal applied AI literacy, and the
content here belongs to anyone who wants to wield it.

For questions, contact the Applied AI Society via https://docs.appliedaisociety.org.
